# default (plan section 6): the page at rest at 1440 x 900, density 2, on a dark system in
# Arctic Ice. Time 0 is the first frame; React's first paint (the grid fading in, the curve
# drawn on, P rising) settles within 1.5 s, so the shot waits 2 s.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot default
